{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.314, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 21, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:22.999Z", "t_ms": 9251, "delta": "A"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.403, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 22, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:23.089Z", "t_ms": 9341, "delta": " Mixture-of-Agents (MoA) architecture and its layers are structured and combined"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.609, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 23, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:23.293Z", "t_ms": 9545, "delta": " as follows:\n\n### Layer Structure\n* An MoA architecture is organized into $l$ sequential layers [C1]."}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.77, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 24, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:23.459Z", "t_ms": 9711, "delta": "\n* Each layer $i$ consists of $n$ LLMs (agents), denoted as $A_{i,1}, A"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.9, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 25, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:23.586Z", "t_ms": 9839, "delta": "_{i,2}, \\dots, A_{i,n}$ [C1]. \n* The framework operates entirely"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.059, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 26, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:23.747Z", "t_ms": 9999, "delta": " via the standard prompt and generation interfaces of off-the-shelf LLMs without requiring fine-tuning or modifications to internal"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.246, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 27, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:23.932Z", "t_ms": 10184, "delta": " activations and weights [C1, C3].\n* Models can be reused across different layers or within the same layer [C"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.572, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:24.253Z", "t_ms": 10505, "delta": "1]. When multiple agents within a layer share the same model, temperature sampling allows them to generate diverse candidate outputs (referred to as a single-"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.72, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:24.408Z", "t_ms": 10660, "delta": "proposer configuration) [C1].\n* By relying on full-fledged LLMs, MoA consolidates the roles"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 11.072, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:24.686Z", "t_ms": 10938, "delta": " of expert networks and gating networks into the models themselves [C3].\n\n### Combining Layer Outputs\n* **Iterative Refinement:**"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 11.122, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:24.812Z", "t_ms": 11064, "delta": " In the first layer, agents independently generate candidate outputs in response to the initial prompt $x_1$ [C1, C6"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 11.372, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:25.058Z", "t_ms": 11310, "delta": "]. These outputs are iteratively passed to the subsequent layer for further refinement [C1, C6].\n* **Aggregate"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 11.531, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:25.220Z", "t_ms": 11472, "delta": "-and-Synthesize Prompting:** For intermediate layer $i$, the combined output $y_i$ is formed"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 11.788, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 34, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:25.437Z", "t_ms": 11689, "delta": " by aggregating the outputs of the $n$ models using a dedicated \"Aggregate-and-Synthesize\" prompt ($\\oplus$)"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 11.997, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 35, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:25.680Z", "t_ms": 11932, "delta": " and concatenating this with the original user prompt $x_1$ ($+$ denotes text concatenation):\n  $$y_i = \\bigoplus"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 12.124, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 36, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:25.813Z", "t_ms": 12066, "delta": "_{j=1}^n [A_{i,j}(x_i)] + x_1, \\quad x_{i+1"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 12.308, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 37, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:25.998Z", "t_ms": 12251, "delta": "} = y_i$$\n  This prompt instructs each agent in the next layer to critically evaluate the provided responses, recognize potential"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 12.446, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 38, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:26.135Z", "t_ms": 12387, "delta": " bias or errors, and synthesize them into a refined, coherent response [C1].\n* **Final Layer Output:** In practice"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 12.689, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 39, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:26.378Z", "t_ms": 12630, "delta": ", intermediate concatenation of all model responses is not required at the final step, meaning only a single LLM is needed in the final layer $"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 12.817, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 40, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:26.505Z", "t_ms": 12757, "delta": "l$ [C1]. The output of this agent, $A_{l,1}(x_l)$, serves"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 12.889, "data": {"request_id": "3a0ff5a2b511", "seq": 41, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:26.578Z", "t_ms": 12830, "delta": " as the final response [C2]."}}
